Yeah, yeah, I know, me too.

506
00:37:48.892 --> 00:37:52.237
Hashtag "bestdayever."
Hashtag "TGIF."

507
00:37:53.897 --> 00:37:57.151
Hashtag "it's-the-end-of-the-world
we're-all-gonna-die-who-gives-a-shit?"

508
00:37:59.360 --> 00:38:01.078
Something's wrong.
They should be back by now.

509
00:38:02.238 --> 00:38:03.535
Easy.

510
00:38:05.158 --> 00:38:07.456
I'm gonna give it another hour
and then we're leaving.

511
00:38:07.911 --> 00:38:09.709
Yeah.
I'm getting a bad feeling.

512
00:38:09.788 --> 00:38:11.586
