Hey, you wanna go back inside?
I can stay out here.

522
00:38:50.995 --> 00:38:53.089
- Where's Mom?
- It's us.

523
00:38:55.166 --> 00:38:56.588
- Are you guys all right?
- Yeah.

524
00:38:56.668 --> 00:38:57.760
