- You're crazy, old man, you know that?

554
00:43:15.384 --> 00:43:18.854
Just got the wind knocked out of me.

555
00:43:18.930 --> 00:43:21.103
Guys, we gotta go. Now.

556
00:43:21.182 --> 00:43:24.482
And we're taking these bodies with us.
Grab those guns, too.

557
00:43:25.895 --> 00:43:27.818
Thanks, Pete. Thank you.

558
00:43:29.357 --> 00:43:31.701
Let's get rid of this thing?

559
00:43:45.039 --> 00:43:46.837
They're gonna
hunt us down now.

560
00:43:48.709 --> 00:43:50.052
